d notified to the Central Bank of Ireland as required.\n\n**After appointment**, the ManCo must:\n- Monitor and review the delegate's performance and compliance on an ongoing basis.\n- Maintain risk management and reporting, and be able to give instructions or terminate the arrangement.\n- Retain enough substance in Ireland to oversee delegates effectively, avoiding \"letterbox\" arrangements.\n\n**Retained responsibility:** Delegation does not transfer accountability. The ManCo remains fully responsible to the fund, its unitholders, and the Central Bank for all delegated functions, as if it had performed them itself.","ttft_ms":4853,"type":"result","duration_ms":6194,"uuid":"5b2fc4ce-4c0f-41d0-91ac-abf2d819ebde","ttft_stream_ms":826,"time_to_request_ms":89,"first_content_frame_ms":826,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
